# The viewer-facing desk, the SAME piece as desk.sprite: its monitor turns its
# BACK to the viewer, a flat casing with a vent grille where the screen would be,
# the stand below it, grain along the boards and the key light's top edge baked in.
#
# OPTIONAL, and the name is the contract: `<base>@<N>x` declares art authored at
# N times `desk`'s size, so this file must stay exactly 4x `desk.sprite`'s
# dimensions or the painter skips it. The cutaway picks the densest variant whose
# N divides its render scale (`densest_frame`).
@frame 0
